This project is an independent Go implementation of the interface and behaviour
of crystaldba/postgres-mcp. It contains no code copied from that project, but
internal/safesql/allowlist_gen.go is generated from its source file and
transcribes its curated lists of statement types, AST node types, function
names, and extension names.

The original is MIT licensed, and it is copyright © 2025 Crystal Corp. Its
license text follows, as the MIT license requires for the material derived from
it.

